## SQ-ABD-02 | Upgrade Aquatic driftwood salvaging moved to CD ids
@group B
@commands Same boot: look up the salvaging ids in the dump
@pass `abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cutting/driftwood_door`, `_sign`, `_trapdoor` gone; `creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_furniture` (10 items incl. `abnormals_delight:driftwood_cabinet`, 0.75 driftwood planks, axe), `.../driftwood_chest_boat`, `.../driftwood_furnace_boat`, `.../<wood>_furnace_boat` for the 9 vanilla woods (crimson and warped give `boatload:` boats), `.../crimson_boat`, `.../warped_boat`, `.../crimson_chest_boat`, `.../warped_chest_boat` present; no `fdCutting` warning in `logs/latest.log`
@fails CD jar
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> zq recipes abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cutting/driftwood_
> zq rdetail salvaging/driftwood_furniture
> zq recipes salvaging/
expect recipes matching abnormals_delight:upgrade_aquatic/cutting/driftwood_: 0$
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_furniture \{
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_chest_boat
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/driftwood_furnace_boat
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/crimson_boat
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/warped_boat
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/crimson_chest_boat
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/warped_chest_boat
count \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/salvaging/[a-z_]+_furnace_boat -> >= 10
kjsreject (?i)fdCutting.*(warn|error)
bootreject (?i)fdCutting.*warn
look driftwood_furniture rdetail: input lists the 10 driftwood items incl. abnormals_delight:driftwood_cabinet (first 3 + "/+7"), result driftwood planks, axe tool; crimson / warped furnace boats take boatload: boats

