## SQ-ABD-04 | pickerelweed tag and the two CD cooking recipes
@group B
@commands Same boot; `/dumptags` or the tag dump
@pass `#creativeengineering:pickerelweed` = blue + purple; `abnormals_delight:pickerelweed_juice` and `pike_with_beetroot` gone; `creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pickerelweed_juice` and `.../pike_with_beetroot` take that tag twice, 1.0 xp, 200 ticks
@fails CD jar
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
> zq itemtag creativeengineering:pickerelweed
> zq rdetail pickerelweed_juice
> zq rdetail pike_with_beetroot
expect itemtag creativeengineering:pickerelweed \(2\): .*upgrade_aquatic:blue_pickerelweed
expect itemtag creativeengineering:pickerelweed \(2\): .*upgrade_aquatic:purple_pickerelweed
reject \[zq\] abnormals_delight:\S*pickerelweed_juice \{
reject \[zq\] abnormals_delight:\S*pike_with_beetroot \{
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pickerelweed_juice(_manual_only)? \{.*pickerelweed.*pickerelweed
expect \[zq\] creativedelight:farmersdelightcooking/pike_with_beetroot \{.*pickerelweed.*pickerelweed
look 1.0 xp and 200 ticks are not printed by /zq (recipe dump or JEI)

